  "text": "The biggest measured turning point was France’s late extra-time surge, capped by Mbappé’s penalty at 118'. [[ev:sb:3869685:4203]] Before that swing, Argentina had produced 3 shots and France 0; afterward, France had 2 and Argentina 0. The pressure had flipped toward France. [[ev:sb:3869685:4199]] [[ev:sb:3869685:4203]]\n\nThe earlier, match-transforming swing was Mbappé’s penalty at 80' followed by his goal at 81'. Across that window, France went from limited attacking threat to controlling the dangerous territory, pulling Argentina into a much more precarious contest. [[ev:sb:3869685:2928]] [[ev:sb:3869685:2987]]",
